# Purpose
Public reference of built-in connector templates: CI/CD, object storage, AI,
cloud, data, web API and other templates with credential type, check and
settings.

# Key Sections
- CI/CD (7), Object Storage (4), AI, Cloud, Data, Web APIs, Other.

# Dependencies
- Template list mirrors what `connector_templates` returns on a node (38 as of
  2026-09-26). Update when templates are added or removed.

# Gotchas
- Settings names (`region`, `bucket`, `container`, `endpoint`, `account`) are
  user-entered connector settings, safe to publish. Do not add internal
  environment variables, probe commands verbatim, routes or account numbers.

# Change History
- 2026-09-26: Created template type reference (38 templates).
